  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners : Alumni Scale Changer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to gain a better understanding of the levels of maturity and needs of Orange Corners (OC) alumni. More insight in the maturity and needs of OC alumni can consequently lead to better alumni programming. The project consists of an alumni self-assessment, followed-up by a synthesis report, and a concise training programme of at least three OC alumni workshops.</narrative>
  </description>
